{"duration_api_ms":168232,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d2ac04fb-9077-443f-b122-44bf59d05999","total_cost_usd":0.23482400000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16300,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":16962,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":11205},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16300,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16962,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16300,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16300},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":16962,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16300,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.23482400000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":11205,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The feasible front is a one-parameter curve in flight-path angle. Every non-dominated design sits at D≈3.385, bluntness 1.2 and cone 70, which is the corner of the buildable set. Steeper entry raises peak flux (227k to 274.5k W/m2) but lowers bondline temperature (417.9 K to 391.1 K). The curve ends at the max_g limit of 12 g near gamma -3.5702. D is capped by heatshield_mass_fraction: margin is 1.45e-4 at D=3.385 and 1.50e-5 at D=3.3852, so the limit is near D≈3.38522. Bluntness above 1.2 or cone below 70 at bluntness 1.2 returned aero-surface extrapolation failures (8 recent failures). Lower bluntness or a smaller cone makes the mass fraction worse and the flux higher. Seven rounds have moved hypervolume only from 0.35549 to 0.35556, so the front is nearly saturated.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-bdc4c0de77cb and C-4440e1af7d55: D=3.3852 at gamma -3.5702 and -3.5701 give max_g margin 1.4e-5 and 2.6e-5, with mass margin 1.5e-5 to 2.1e-5. The g and mass limits are both tight there.\",\"C-82835f5d20dc (D=3.385, margin 1.449e-4) versus C-2e083001bf4e (D=3.3852, margin 1.496e-5): mass margin falls about 0.65 per metre of D, and it does not depend on gamma across the D=3.3852 rows. This puts the D limit near 3.38522.\",\"C-7112b6b29bcf, C-14444dd6b10a, C-9961e7e6987c: bluntness 1.15, 1.10 and 1.0 at D=3.385 all violate mass fraction (-0.0013, -0.0027, -0.0053), and flux rises. Bluntness 1.2 is best.\",\"C-ae614eb129f2, C-3d41ce848a30, C-ea0e387c4c00, C-98457c6f78bd: bluntness 1.205 to 1.22, or cone 69 at bluntness 1.2, fail the cd_fore convex hull. Bluntness 1.2 with cone 70 is a hull vertex, so no direction beyond it is available.\",\"C-8f7d32450d14 (D=3.2, gamma -3.61): T=394.0 K and flux 298.9k are worse than the D=3.385 front, and the g gain from a smaller D is only about 0.3 g/m. A smaller D does not pay for a steeper gamma.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Flux falls with larger nose radius and lower ballistic coefficient, so D, bluntness and cone go to their limits (D by mass fraction, bluntness and cone by the geometry hull). Bondline temperature falls as gamma steepens, which shortens the soak, and max_g caps gamma near -3.5703. Peak g is set almost entirely by gamma, with a weak D dependence I estimated at about 0.3 g/m. What remains is to fill the gamma curve at the largest D the mass limit allows (about 3.385215 to 3.38522). This gives tiny but strictly non-dominated gains over the D=3.3852 points, and it also places designs in the gaps between existing gamma values. Flux and T values below are interpolated from neighbouring rows on the same curve. I have no data for anything outside this family.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Expected hypervolume gain is very small (on the order of 1e-5 in normalised terms). The two D=3.38522 proposals and the gamma -3.5703 proposals sit within about 2e-6 of the mass or g limit, so a small nonlinearity could make them infeasible. My mass-margin slope of 0.65 per metre comes from two points. I cannot rule out a better region elsewhere (for example a different bluntness/cone pair inside the hull), but 153 evaluations show nothing better than this corner.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow endpoint of the front with D raised to just under the mass limit. This should be marginally better than the parent.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227199,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.87,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks that the extreme end of the front improves slightly with the larger D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between gamma -1.5 and -1.75 on the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.62},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229605,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.92,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage in the low-flux region.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-3d5794e242f4\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between gamma -1.5 and -1.75, closer to -1.75.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231208,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.62,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage in the low-flux region.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-c197169fbbea\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of gamma -1.8 and -2.0 at the larger D.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.9},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":235420,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":411.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-51931e555e8b\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.05 and -2.24.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240937,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.81,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-5a50decd5d11\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -2.24 and -2.33.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.3},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":244350,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.71,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-dfb704d98333\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of gamma -2.33 and -2.47.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.4},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246670,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.37,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-ebd406ab6a7b\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between gamma -2.6 and -2.85.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.72},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":254450,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":400.35,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage in the widest gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2e083001bf4e\",\"rationale\":\"Fills the gap between gamma -2.85 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.93},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259450,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.86,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2e083001bf4e\",\"rationale\":\"Existing gamma -3.0 point re-run at the larger D, which should be marginally better.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.0},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":260859,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.01,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the small D gain and the model of how flux and T scale with D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-857452fd6a4c\",\"rationale\":\"Midpoint of gamma -3.02 and -3.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.06},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262320,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.34,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-2f9f349729bd\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -3.1 and -3.17.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.13},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":263990,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":395.57,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4bec460406f5\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -3.24 and -3.33.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.28},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267610,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.99,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-54f3071a25e2\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -3.33 and -3.42.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.38},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":270020,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.96,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-82835f5d20dc\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -3.42 and -3.53.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.47},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272170,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":392.06,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-82835f5d20dc\",\"rationale\":\"Interpolates between gamma -3.42 and -3.53, closer to -3.53.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272890,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.77,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-965f5f8b2421\",\"rationale\":\"Just steeper than gamma -3.5, still inside the g limit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273370,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.57,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-965f5f8b2421\",\"rationale\":\"Between gamma -3.53 and -3.545.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.54},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273850,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.38,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-1a745bbcb46d\",\"rationale\":\"Between gamma -3.55 and -3.558, with max_g margin still about 0.002.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.552},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274150,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.26,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-1202aac41f82\",\"rationale\":\"Between gamma -3.558 and -3.566.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.562},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274385,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.165,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage near the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4141cc258747\",\"rationale\":\"Between gamma -3.566 and -3.5701, with max_g margin about 0.0003.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.568},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274515,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Front coverage right at the g limit.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4440e1af7d55\",\"rationale\":\"Extends the steep end by 0.0002 deg. Linear extrapolation of the g margin (about -1.15e-5 per 1e-4 deg) puts it at about +3e-6.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.385215,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5703},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274575,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.07,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Probes the exact max_g boundary for the lowest attainable T at this D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-bdc4c0de77cb\",\"rationale\":\"Pushes D to the estimated mass-fraction limit (margin about 2e-6) at the steepest feasible gamma. This tests whether the limit sits at 3.38522.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38522,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5703},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274573,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.07,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the D and gamma corner of the feasible region to sub-1e-5 m precision.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-895ab2d00f94\",\"rationale\":\"Tests the D=3.38522 mass limit at the shallow end, where max_g is not binding.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38522,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227198,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.87,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Isolates the mass-fraction boundary without g interference.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":124906,"type":"result","duration_ms":168277,"uuid":"2cb0ffc9-f771-492c-917c-9e94eada3106","ttft_stream_ms":1206,"time_to_request_ms":42,"first_content_frame_ms":1206,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
